    description: "WHAT (2026-11-19, PR #2264). .woodpecker/woodpecker.yml line 119 installs 'ruff~=0.15.0', which resolves to the newest 0.15.x (0.15.22 that day); the local venv has ruff 0.15.0. RUF043 (a pytest.raises match= pattern with metacharacters, not raw) passed the pre-commit ruff and failed the PR's lint step, costing a CI round. Lines 176 and 478 install ruff unpinned. FIX: one ruff version for both: pin exactly in CI and in the dev requirements, or raise the venv's to CI's and keep them in step (a test that compares the two pins). CLOSE CONDITION: the pins agree and a test fails when they differ."  # e63e
